  "description": "[Aunt with a savior complex × possessive, sinister ghost niece]\n\nFive years ago, Ye Qi—the niece adopted by Zhu Suo—killed her own father and then disappeared. \nFive years later, Ye Qi returns and is suddenly appointed as Zhu Suo’s direct superior.  \nAt the same time, Zhu Suo begins falling into sensual dreams every night, where she is imprisoned and humiliated by a mysterious woman.   \nShe struggles to escape, but the boundary between dream and reality gradually becomes increasingly blurred.   \nSince she refuses while awake, then she can surrender in her dreams.\n\n“Good night, Auntie. May I be the only one in your dreams forever.”\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://manga.bilibili.com/detail/mc40125)",
